[2m│[0m [1m[38;5;231mHow should the contract handle the ellipsis and the existing prefix/suffix options?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mEllipsis counts; truncate last (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mGuarantees result.length <= maxLength for the final string, including prefix and suffix. A suffix can be cut off.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Ellipsis counts; truncate before prefix/suffix
     [38;5;246mPrefix and suffix always survive intact, but the returned string can exceed maxLength.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Ellipsis added on top; truncate last
     [38;5;246mCuts to maxLength then appends '...', so output can be maxLength + 3.[39m
